      \field{abstract}{Recycling has been touted as a solution to combat the global plastic pollution crisis, but recycling rates of 10\% are ineffective against annual plastic production of {>}460 million tonnes. Solutions beyond recycling, such as capping production, improved product design, alternative materials, phasing out problematic plastics, and reduction and reuse strategies, are needed.}
